<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT-Viking Office cut to hold.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-Viking Office cut to hold.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-07-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>ABN AMRO Chicago Corp analyst Mark Mandel said he downgraded Viking Office Products Inc to hold from buy.</p>
<p>-- said the share price is near his 12-month target of $21.</p>
<p>-- shares in the office products company were up 3/8 to 19-3/8.</p>
<p>((--Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8787))</p>
</text>
